    <!-- 9. Built for the people who debug machines (docs/24, docs/26) -->
    <section class="wrap">
      <h2>Built for the people who debug machines</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card"><h3>🔬 See the media plane</h3><p>The live pipeline graph, with rates and drops, on the machine and in your dashboard — readable by a support engineer or an AI coding agent. <a href="/24-pipeline-introspection/">Introspection</a></p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>✅ One command says if it's healthy</h3><p><code>sudo fjarr-agent --check</code> lists every configured source and backend, and gives the one-line fix for anything missing. <a href="/26-robot-install-and-drivers/">Install &amp; drivers</a></p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>🧩 Only the drivers it needs</h3><p><code>fjarr-agent drivers detect</code> matches the hardware actually attached against a catalog and names the package each needs. Install those, and nothing else lands on the machine.</p></div>
